      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive clinical team with bedside friction"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners praise Dr. Coronato and the clinic team for dedicated, personal veterinary care and compassionate support during appointments. Many clients appreciate having a familiar neighborhood doctor. At the same time, several reviewers report negative interactions, describing dismissive remarks from the veterinarian or abrupt phone communication when scheduling appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling during examinations and procedures"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog and cat owners frequently commend the gentle care shown to their pets during physical exams, routine blood draws, and surgical procedures. Reviewers note that cats and anxious puppies remain calm throughout intake visits, with assistants taking time to comfort companion animals."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Detailed medical explanations alongside phone disputes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight thorough medical explanations, with the doctor walking them through puppy vaccines, diagnostic lab tests, and postoperative follow-up calls. Conversely, multiple visitors express frustration over phone interactions, citing unhelpful responses to routine questions and difficulties obtaining external pharmacy prescriptions."
      }
    }
  ],
